Type `chat` to open weechat in #runv on tilde.chat, the IRC network the
tilde servers share. The first run sets everything up with your
username as your nick. After that it's ordinary weechat.

Register your nick so nobody else takes it. Inside weechat:

  /msg NickServ REGISTER yourpassword you@example.org

From a browser: https://tilde.chat/gamja/
Prefer irssi? irc.tilde.chat, port 6697, TLS.

tilde.chat has its own rules: https://tilde.wiki/Code_of_conduct
